spice
* NPN Transistor
Q1 4 3 5 QMOD

* Current Source
I1 2 5 DC 0.1mA

* Voltage Sources
Vsig 8 9 AC 1
Vcc 10 3 DC 3V

* Resistors
R1 7 3 20k
R2 5 7 200k
R3 3 6 20k
R4 2 6 250

* Capacitors
C1 7 8 inf
C2 3 6 inf

* Model Definition for NPN Transistor
.model QMOD NPN

* Nodes
* 1 = Collector of Transistor
* 2 = Emitter of Transistor
* 3 = Base of Transistor
* 4 = Collector connected to Vcc
* 5 = Emitter connected to ground with current source
* 6 = Output Node
* 7 = Node between R1 and C1 
* 8 = Input Node
* 9 = Ground connected to Vsig
* 10 = Vcc 

.END